MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Closes #13 (gqf2008/brewfs) — non-meta scope

- ObjectBlockStore: delete unused sync constructors (new /
  new_with_config / new_with_configs) that used block_on + unwrap in
  async contexts (potential panic); async new_async /
  new_with_configs_async remain. Delete unused cache_block helper and
  the now-unused futures::executor::block_on import.
- daemon/worker.rs: remove empty start_upload_workers stub (upload
  concurrency lives in the writer's upload tasks).
- fuse/adapter.rs: remove empty register_callbacks placeholder module.
- vfs/mod.rs / cadapter/mod.rs: remove stale module-level TODO lines.
- Deferred to the meta-service redesign (kept intentionally):
  meta/migrations.rs ensure_migrations placeholder; read_at_into wiring
  is tracked by #6.
